# SDE / ML Portfolio — Implementation Plan

Build a **single-page, scrollable portfolio website** for an SDE/ML-focused CS grad student at George Mason University (graduating 2026). The site should feel modern, interactive, and premium.

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Scaffold | **Vite + React** | Fast dev server, tiny bundle, zero-config |
| Styling | **Bootstrap 5 + React-Bootstrap** | Responsive grid, ready-made components |
| Animations | **AOS (Animate On Scroll)** | Scroll-triggered fade/slide effects |
| Icons | **React Icons** | FontAwesome / Devicons in one package |
| Popup modals | **React-Bootstrap `<Modal>`** | Native Bootstrap modal, no extra lib |
| Deployment | **GitHub Pages** (free) | One command via `gh-pages` npm package |

---

## Site Architecture (single `index.html`, one React app)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Navbar  (sticky, smooth-scroll links)  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Hero / About Me                        │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Work Experience   → click card → Modal │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Education                              │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Projects          → click card → Modal │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Achievements                           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Contact (form / links)                 │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Footer                                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

Each section scrolls into view; clicking a **card** opens a **Bootstrap Modal** with full details.

---

## What Makes It Catchy 🎯

| Technique | Where |
|---|---|
| **Dark-mode hero** with gradient overlay & animated typing text | Hero section |
| **Glassmorphism cards** (frosted glass effect) | Work, Projects |
| **AOS scroll animations** (fade-up, zoom-in) | Every section |
| **Hover scale + glow** on cards | Work, Projects, Achievements |
| **Accent color scheme** — electric blue / teal on dark background | Global |
| **Skill tag chips** with icons | Hero / About |
| **Smooth scroll** via CSS `scroll-behavior: smooth` | Navbar links |
| **Responsive** — mobile-first Bootstrap grid | Everywhere |

