## File Structure

```
Portfolio/
├── public/
│   └── headshot.webp          ← your photo (we'll generate a placeholder)
├── src/
│   ├── main.jsx               ← entry point
│   ├── App.jsx                ← root, section layout
│   ├── App.css                ← global styles, dark theme, glassmorphism
│   ├── data/
│   │   └── profile.js         ← ALL your content (easy to edit in one place)
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── Navbar.jsx
│   │   ├── Hero.jsx
│   │   ├── Work.jsx
│   │   ├── Education.jsx
│   │   ├── Projects.jsx
│   │   ├── Achievements.jsx
│   │   ├── Contact.jsx
│   │   ├── Footer.jsx
│   │   └── DetailModal.jsx   ← reusable popup for cards
│   └── assets/                ← any images / icons
├── index.html
├── package.json
└── vite.config.js
```

> [!TIP]
> All your personal info lives in **`src/data/profile.js`** — a single JS object. You only ever edit that one file to update content.

