### Components

#### [NEW] [App.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/App.jsx)
Root component that stacks all sections vertically and initializes AOS.

#### [NEW] [Navbar.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Navbar.jsx)
Sticky top navbar with smooth-scroll anchor links to each section. Collapses to hamburger on mobile.

#### [NEW] [Hero.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Hero.jsx)
Full-viewport dark hero with name, tagline, animated typing effect, skill chips, and CTA buttons.

#### [NEW] [Work.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Work.jsx)
Grid of glassmorphism cards for work experience. Clicking a card opens `DetailModal` with full description, tech stack, and highlights.

#### [NEW] [Education.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Education.jsx)
Timeline-style layout showing degrees, university, GPA, and relevant coursework.

#### [NEW] [Projects.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Projects.jsx)
Card grid for projects. Each card shows title, short description, and tech tags. Click opens `DetailModal` with full write-up and links (GitHub, demo).

#### [NEW] [Achievements.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Achievements.jsx)
Cards or badges for certifications, awards, hackathons, publications. Click opens detail modal if needed.

#### [NEW] [Contact.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Contact.jsx)
Contact form (or mailto link) + social icons (GitHub, LinkedIn, email).

#### [NEW] [Footer.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/Footer.jsx)
Minimal footer with copyright and social links.

#### [NEW] [DetailModal.jsx](file:///d:/job%20search/Self-Learn/Portfolio/src/components/DetailModal.jsx)
Reusable React-Bootstrap Modal that receives title, body content, tags, and links as props. Used by Work, Projects, and Achievements sections.

